  <data name="PlusWhatsNewVersion" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Version</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlusWhatsNewCredit.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Based on FluentWeather 2.1.0 by Gabboxl. Updated by duedilly108.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlusWhatsNewIntro.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>FluentWeather-Plus adds these features to FluentWeather 2.1.0:</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlusWhatsNewBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>- Saved locations, up to 25, with keyboard shortcuts.
- Tray icons with the temperature, a weather picture and a hover panel of chosen details.
- Past days: yesterday and the day before, next to today.
- Full History: daily and hourly weather of a saved location back to 1940.
- A radar map for US locations, and air quality for every location.
- Nearby water: the water temperature and wind at the closest station.
- Extra data: waves, a wind forecast, other forecast models, river flow and pollen.
- Severe weather alerts in the main window and as a tray bubble.
- More data: airport weather, snow, heat stress, storm energy, soil, freezing level,
  sunshine, buoys, river gauges, day details, an hourly chart and the NWS discussion.
- Detail cards with more detail on hover, in any order you choose.
- Settings for text size, background contrast, card tint and the hourly range.
- A language setting, a direct installer and a crash report.
- Plus many GUI refinements.</value>
  </data>
